# Canonical host (https + non-www) is NOT handled here.
# Cloudflare Workers static assets only accept RELATIVE paths in _redirects,
# and does not accept Netlify's "301!" force suffix. Three absolute-URL rules
# were added here on Sep 8 2026 to consolidate the four indexed variants GSC
# was showing; they broke EVERY deploy from ~12:00 CT that day with:
#   Line 5: Only relative URLs are allowed.
#   Line 6/7: Valid status codes are 200, 301, 302, 303, 307, or 308. Got 0.
# The site silently stopped updating until it was caught at 1:30 PM.
# Host canonicalisation belongs in a zone-level Redirect Rule instead.

/record    /games.html   301
/record.html    /games.html   301
